  "description": "\"I... got a boner\" is what Jihyun blurts out the first time he lays eyes on Yohan's handsome face... It's easy to get laid when you're a pretty, sassy bartender working at a popular gay bar. This lifestyle suits Jihyun just fine since he loves casual hookups without any intimacy… That is until he meets Yohan—his big, scary-looking classmate who's actually a pure-hearted sweetie. Can Yohan's simple love help commitment-phobic Jihyun heal from the traumas of his past?\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/zGOzSoon), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/jigojisoon), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/2968001562), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000046520), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=5788940)   \nR15: [Bomtoon](https://bomtoon.com/detail/zGOzSoon)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nR19: [English](https://tapas.io/series/love-so-pure-mature/info), [French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/daf_1000479), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/124483), [German](https://www.lezhinde.com/detail/dad_2000100)  \nR15: [English](https://tapas.io/series/love-so-pure/info), [French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/daf_1000478), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/124482), [German](https://www.lezhinde.com/detail/dad_2000099), [S.Chinese](https://manga.bilibili.com/detail/mc31497)  \nPrint: Portuguese",
